rooms_desc ({"Syrah's main room","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","You are standing on a plateau near the top of the volcano. Theair is here very hot and the gas coming from the volcano nearlycauses you to fall into unconsciousness. To the north and ewestyou see the blue sea. Far in the distance you can see a 'BigVolcano Peak' in the middle of the ocean. Strange, but it looksnearly like the mountain where you are. Only this volcano peakdoesn't seem active. Maybe in earlier times part of island sunkin the ocean.","Warm sand is the first thing that you notice about this place. The sand movesbetween your toes as you look about. Water laps at the edge of the beach beforeyou. It appears that it's an ocean out there, since you can't see the other sideand you can smell the salt. The sun is low on the horizon. You turn, and seeyour shadow stretch long behind you. Syrah's castle and a few small bungalosstand behind you, the castle gleaming white. You realize that you mustbe in Syrah's realm, as the sun never sets here. This is one of the places thatSyrah had set aside for sunsets...   ...something romantic...","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","The ground here is trampled and dirty. Tents ancookingfires lie scattered in a random array of chaos. The smellof burn food and unwashed bodies fills the air.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,})
